## Conventions

- **PRs are squash-merged.** The PR title becomes the sole commit on `main`,
  so the **PR title must follow Conventional Commits** (`feat:` / `fix:` /
  `feat!:` / `BREAKING CHANGE:` etc.). Branch commits are exempt — clear
  messages are enough. release-please reads merged PR titles for versioning.

